<title>UK: Sema Group up on newspaper recommendation.</title>
<headline>Sema Group up on newspaper recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sema Group Plc rose in early trading on Monday after a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation in the Sunday Times' &quot;Inside Track&quot; share column, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 7-1/2p at a record 830 by 0715 GMT, extending a rally from 645-1/2 at the end of May.</p>
<p>The paper said the software and services sector is going through a period of strong growth and rationalisation, with Sema set for strong organic growth and further acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
